# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Order storage — local CSV server (server/index.js)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Orders submitted on the site are POSTed to a small local Node server, which
# appends each one to a CSV file on your machine. No .env is required to run —
# these are all optional overrides.

# Where the server saves orders (default: ./orders.csv in the project root).
# ORDERS_CSV=/Users/you/Desktop/sdc-orders.csv

# Port the order server listens on (default: 3001).
# PORT=3001

# Frontend override: where the site sends orders. Defaults to /api/order,
# which works in dev (Vite proxy) and in production (same server serves both).
# Only set this if you run the server on a different host/port.
# VITE_ORDER_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:3001/api/order
